{"approved":false,"back_sample":null,"beam_size":2,"checks":{"no_residual_markers":true,"nonempty":true,"not_truncated":true,"protected_values":true,"translated":true},"context":"effective-interest-rate-calculator UI copy.howAnswer","detected_language":"sw","format":"usefulverse-background-draft-v1","key":"effective-interest-rate-calculator.copy.howAnswer","keys":["effective-interest-rate-calculator.copy.howAnswer"],"locale":"sw","model":"google/madlad400-3b-mt","raw_translation":"Kwa mara kwa mara kuchanganya, APY = (ZXQPH0000QXZ + APR ÷ m) ^ m - ZXQPH0001QXZ, ambapo m ni idadi ya vipindi kuchanganya kwa mwaka. Kubadilisha APY nyuma kwa APR jina, kutumia APR = m × ((ZXQPH0002QXZ + APY) ^ (ZXQPH0003QXZ / m) − ZXQPH0004QXZ). Kuendelea kuchanganya matumizi APY = e ^ APR - ZXQPH0005QXZ. Kuingia viwango kama asilimia; kwa mfano, ZXQPH0006QXZ maana ZXQPH0007QXZ.","record_id":"cbb0b98f092195ef7faeca11c0da7c7c7ba2c51295baa087e05ee0b6d4dfd192","revision":"fa184c675da0b5c9e1c8694fccd4e12e2d422094","run_id":"40565692987","seconds":4.165720437499999,"source":"For periodic compounding, APY = (1 + APR ÷ m)^m − 1, where m is the number of compounding periods per year. To convert APY back to nominal APR, use APR = m × ((1 + APY)^(1/m) − 1). Continuous compounding uses APY = e^APR − 1. Enter rates as percentages; for example, 12 means 12%.","source_commit":"e8a7cb94dc75d40f2c0e14bb27c0a1819e230012","source_hash":"fe78b074adbd1d99e0a797d7cf4aab3016d94b38ff9812d5eef74ae6613339fa","status":"machine-draft","translation":"Kwa mara kwa mara kuchanganya, APY = (1 + APR ÷ m) ^ m - 1, ambapo m ni idadi ya vipindi kuchanganya kwa mwaka. Kubadilisha APY nyuma kwa APR jina, kutumia APR = m × ((1 + APY) ^ (1 / m) − 1). Kuendelea kuchanganya matumizi APY = e ^ APR - 1. Kuingia viwango kama asilimia; kwa mfano, 12 maana 12%.","truncated":false,"warnings":[]}
